  "summary_l1": "Poison Fog Dungeon, second floor. A fog beast ambushes them; Mu-jin shoves Do-yoon clear and takes venom in his left calf. Do-yoon, using prior-life memory, strikes the beast's glowing organ and drives it off, but Mu-jin calls it luck. Do-yoon recovers a second mana stone from the fog. The old compass slips from his pocket and its needle trembles; Mu-jin notices nothing. On the stairs Mu-jin tells Do-yoon he pays his debts. At the gate tent Do-yoon overrides Mu-jin and gets him onto a stretcher; the clerk notes their two-hour clear. The venom reaches Mu-jin's knee.",
  "ending_hook": "Outside the gate, the black venom had climbed to Mu-jin’s knee.",
